    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who is Thelma Fantastic?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Octogenarian, 12 grandkids, 2 husbands (both deceased), president of the local knitting club, and possibly the <strong>worlds greatest detective</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827630/extras/84942ace96b36233bc95c8c0fa6d07ca.avif?t=1751725191\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find Suspect's Missing Objects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suspects are not keen to help unless <strong>you help them first</strong>. Find a few objects and learn the truths that make solving a case easy.\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827630/extras/6c87b506acf9bc5eee7716d8d6084076.avif?t=1751725191\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the clues and apply logic and intuition to become a skilled detective and crack the cases. The sudden rise in crime can't be a coincidence can it?\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Work for a Legend and Maybe Become One Yourself</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test yourself against Thelma Fantastic in the casual and timed modes featuring randomly generated hidden object scenes with random characters, items, and placement.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited replay-ability.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expected Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story mode featuring hidden object levels, and logic puzzles, and a mysterious shadow over the city</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique characters to help and learn about.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of animated objects to find and explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prebuilt and randomized levels.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A casual mode for replay-ability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A timed mode to challenge yourself</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who is Thelma Fantastic?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Octogenarian, 12 grandkids, 2 husbands (both deceased), president of the local knitting club, and possibly the <strong>worlds greatest detective</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827630/extras/84942ace96b36233bc95c8c0fa6d07ca.avif?t=1751725191\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find Suspect's Missing Objects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suspects are not keen to help unless <strong>you help them first</strong>. Find a few objects and learn the truths that make solving a case easy.\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827630/extras/6c87b506acf9bc5eee7716d8d6084076.avif?t=1751725191\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the clues and apply logic and intuition to become a skilled detective and crack the cases. The sudden rise in crime can't be a coincidence can it?\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Work for a Legend and Maybe Become One Yourself</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test yourself against Thelma Fantastic in the casual and timed modes featuring randomly generated hidden object scenes with random characters, items, and placement.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited replay-ability.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expected Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story mode featuring hidden object levels, and logic puzzles, and a mysterious shadow over the city</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique characters to help and learn about.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of animated objects to find and explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prebuilt and randomized levels.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A casual mode for replay-ability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A timed mode to challenge yourself</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A hidden object mystery game. Help Thelma Fantastic find missing objects, discovery important clues, and solve mysteries. A charming story and a fun adventure. Plus a custom mode for unlimited hidden object level generation.",
